  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSTRUCTION OF SAVALOU DJOUGOU ROAD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THE PROJECT IS THE CONSTRUCTION OF AN ALL WEATHER ROAD FROM SAVALOU TO DJOUGOU OVER A LENGTH OF 228KM. THIS SECTION OF ROAD IS PART OF A REGIONAL PROJECT LINKING BENIN TO BURKINA FASO AND MALI AND PROVIDING THESE 2 COUNTRIES WITH A DIRECT ACCESS TO THE PORT OF COTONOU AND IT WILL ALSO OPEN UP THE TWO PROVINCES OF ZOU AND ATACORA IN BENIN..</narrative>
  </description>
